{"meta":{"id":"selector-filter","category":"it/syntax/jquery/dom","title":"선택자 · filter · jQuery","subtitle":"(JQUERY · AJAX)","summary":"CSS 선택자, filter(index, el), eq · find · parent 탐색","tags":["jquery","f-selector","f-dom"],"color":"cyan","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-cyan","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-cyan-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-cyan-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-cyan-50 text-cyan-700 border border-cyan-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></span>JQUERY · AJAX</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">선택자 · filter · jQuery</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-cyan-50/70 border border-cyan-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> CSS 선택자, filter(index, el), eq · find · parent 탐색</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">선택자 · filter</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">$(&quot;#id&quot;)  $(&quot;.class&quot;)  $(&quot;input[type=&#x27;text&#x27;]&quot;)  $(&quot;.list &gt; li&quot;)   // CSS 선택자 그대로\r\n\r\n$(&quot;.list li&quot;).css(&quot;color&quot;, &quot;lightgray&quot;)\r\n  .filter((index, el) =&gt; index % 2 === 0).css(&quot;color&quot;, &quot;orange&quot;)   // 짝수 번째만\r\n  .filter(&quot;.test2&quot;).css(&quot;fontSize&quot;, &quot;20pt&quot;);                       // 그중 .test2 만\r\n\r\n$(&quot;.list li&quot;).eq(0);  .first();  .last();  .find(&quot;span&quot;);  .parent();  .children();</pre></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-cyan-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">index: 같은 선택 결과 안에서의 순서 (0 부터)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-cyan-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">el: 해당 DOM 요소 — $(el) 로 감싸면 jQuery 메서드 사용</span></div></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> CSS › 선택자</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/jquery/dom/selector-filter","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"jquery","title":"JQUERY · AJAX","path":"it/syntax/jquery"},{"id":"dom","title":"DOM 조작","path":"it/syntax/jquery/dom"}],"hasImage":false}